      "date": "2026-02-04T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Subam Papers Limited announced that it has received INR 743.6752 million in funding from a group of investors",
      "body": "On February 4, 2026, Subam Papers Limited closed the transaction. The company issued 2,632,800 convertible warrants at an issue price of INR 38 for gross proceeds of INR 100,046,400 and 4,234,400 equity shares at an issue price of INR 643,628,800  for total aggregate gross proceeds of INR 743,675,200. The transaction included participation from Thirupathi Balakumar for 1,316,000 warrants, BMM Paper Board Private Limited for 987,200 warrants, Alagarsamy Sudha for 329,600 warrants, Invicta Continuum Fund I for 4,99,200 shares, Invicta Finserv Private Limited for 2,99,200 shares, MD Pai Partners LLP for 2,04,000 shares, Invicta Capserv Private Limited for 49,600 shares, Avvanti Advisors Private Limited  for 32,800 shares, Jinraj Enterprises LLP  for 19,200 shares and includes other investors.",
